sequenceDiagram
  participant ECU as ECU/Sim (PC Tools)
  participant ESP as ESP32 TWAI
  participant SM as State Model
  participant UI as UI (LVGL)
  ECU->>ESP: CAN PT_FAST / VEH_SPEED / ...
  ESP->>SM: Decode + update signals + timestamps
  UI->>SM: Read snapshot (every 50ms)
  UI-->>UI: Render widgets + handle timeouts
